<title>JAPAN: Hoko Fishing - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hoko Fishing - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 45.46		vs	   40.45</p>
<p> Operating	   33    million	  vs	  438    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 225    million	  vs	prft 217 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 289    million	  vs	 prft 66 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 4.83 yen	  vs     prft 1.10 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     60 million	  vs	  60 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hoko Fishing Co Ltd is a manufacturer of marine products.</p>
